     8665                                             buffer buf-new_trn-doc).
     8666                       assign
     8667                       r-qnty = 0
     8668                       r-b-code = ?
     8669                       r-pl-code = ?
     8670                       rgds-dtl = ?.
     8671                       find current buf_trn-doc exclusive-lock .
     8672                       run RSRV-line in this-procedure (input 1,
     8673                                                        input no,
